1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,830
I wanted to keep mine dry so taking a pebble along was fine by me.
我想让自己的脚保持干燥，所以带一颗小石子同行，对我来说也可以。

2
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:22,759
I'm just set off then on the english coast to coast only 182 mi left not too many.
我刚出发，开始英格兰的 coast to coast 徒步。只剩一百八十二英里了，也没多少嘛。

3
00:00:22,759 --> 00:00:25,480
There's something about the coast that makes me happy.
海岸总有某种东西让我开心。

4
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:35,790
The ocean the seab breeze and the sounds of birds chirping it just sits well with me.
海洋、海风、鸟儿啁啾的声音，都让我觉得很舒心。

5
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,160
I'm just leaving the coast now and have a look blue skies sun's out.
我现在正离开海岸。看看，蓝天，太阳出来了。

6
00:00:58,160 --> 00:01:27,279
But I'm heading towards the lakes and the hills and have a look at this cloud lots of incline looks fun.
但我正朝湖区和山丘走。看看这片云，还有好多上坡，看着挺有意思。

7
00:01:27,279 --> 00:01:32,240
It was the peak of the english springtime the flowers and trees were as green as ever.
那时正值英格兰春意最浓的时候，花草树木一如既往地绿。

8
00:01:32,240 --> 00:01:49,150
Lambs were playing in the fields and the insects were out I was pretty grateful.
小羊在田野里玩耍，昆虫也出来了，我心里很感激。

9
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:59,800
Just set up for the night ended up doing about just over 18 miles which is pretty good going.
刚刚把过夜的地方安顿好，最后走了略多于十八英里，我觉得这进度挺不错。

10
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:07,240
I think I set off at about 1 00 p m and right now it's about 7 30 so yeah.
我大约下午一点出发，现在大概七点半，所以，嗯。

11
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:15,279
The last though it was this is called anadale water or something like that.
最后那段……这地方好像叫字幕写作 anadale water 的名字，或者类似的名字。

12
00:02:15,279 --> 00:02:24,119
And all there you see like just the it's quite sheer and it's a lot lot of boulders and stones.
那边，你能看到，有点……挺陡的，而且有很多大石块和碎石。

13
00:02:24,119 --> 00:02:31,829
So happy to get that over and done with but tomorrow I just set off and then we go between that valley there.
很高兴那段终于走完了。不过明天出发后，就要往那边山谷之间走。

14
00:02:31,839 --> 00:02:50,650
I mean what view this is what a what a place just to to end the first day not too shabby.
我是说，这景色，这是什么样的地方啊。能在这里结束第一天，真不错。

15
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:19,400
I woke up that morning feeling well rested so I set off ready for a great day.
那天早晨醒来，我觉得休息得很好，于是出发，准备迎接美好的一天。

16
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:28,840
I decided not to carry a watch on adventures like this time isn't a thing the sun was my clock.
我决定这类冒险不戴手表，时间似乎不再重要，太阳就是我的时钟。
